{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50615","headline":"翻经台 · 包佶","name":"翻经台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野蔓高台下，前朝记不诬。\n金文翻古偈，汉字变胡书。\n彩缐风飘断，缃缣火烬余。\n破云开白日，穿水照芙蕖。\n科斗频更改，庵园几遍锄。\n真门兼逸韵，两欲慕相如。\n（见《永乐大典》卷二六○三「七皆」「台」迈「翻经台」条〖三函三十册〗。\n复见同书卷六六九九「十八阳」「江」字〖七函六十四册〗。\n）（见《吉石庵丛书》影印日本存古抄本北宋陈舜俞《庐山记》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}